    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Lock it in\n\n**This is what makes the poll do something.** The old version had a hard-coded 'everyone opted in' stub.\n\nTelegram sends a `poll_answer` update the moment somebody taps. Option index 0 is *I'm in*.\n\n**Point your bot's webhook here:**\n`https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/setWebhook?url=<this webhook>&allowed_updates=[\"poll_answer\"]`",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "name": "n1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
